WEBVTT

00:00:00.666 --> 00:00:03.666
-Ugh, cut it out, Logan!
-No way!

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:06.416
If we can't have fun in
the Dream World, what's the point?

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.875
Go long!

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:14.500
Whoa! Whew. Whoa.

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:17.458
Logan! Stop fooling around.

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:20.000
What if I would have
dropped this thing?

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.750
Dream Chasers!

00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:28.666
It looks like you have something
that belongs to me!

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.333
Yeah! What he said!
He crossed the road to get it!

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.125
Logan? Remember how
you wanted to play catch?

00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:38.541
-Yeah.
-Then run!

00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:49.291
-Go long!
<i>-Let me out of here!</i>

00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:57.833
Logan!

00:00:57.916 --> 00:01:01.333
Throw me the crystal, and we'll
save you from drowning!

00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:04.166
No chance, Loser King!

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.666
Get out of here! Wake up, Logan!

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.250
Then he'd get the crystal!

00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:13.208
Have to keep it safe!

00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:15.916
No!

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.041
Now, retrieve my crystal!

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:21.291
I will need it to grow my army.

00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:52.708
Looks like your friend wasn't quite
the athlete he claimed to be.

00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:55.583
Don't be sad, Dream Bandit.

00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:59.166
You will soon join your friend
in the darkness

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:01.750
which will be the Dream World!

00:02:01.833 --> 00:02:03.791
Logan?

00:02:15.791 --> 00:02:18.875
Did I just Beast Craft
with that little critter?

00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:20.416
Noice!

00:02:23.916 --> 00:02:26.166
Here comes the CrocStar!

00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:32.458
Izzie, Mateo, come in.

00:02:39.958 --> 00:02:42.041
Nice crocodile?

00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:49.583
Ugh, it's just static.
Coop? Come in, Coop!

00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:53.125
Gah! Another time, Dream Chaser!

00:02:53.208 --> 00:02:55.833
Darkness will triumph!

00:02:58.041 --> 00:03:01.250
Wait, wait up! Wait for me!

00:03:05.416 --> 00:03:08.583
Unexpected. Wanna pursue?

00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:11.083
I don't think this little fella
is up for it.

00:03:11.166 --> 00:03:14.000
Look, Logan, this is big!

00:03:14.083 --> 00:03:16.791
The Nightmare King is definitely
up to no good.

00:03:16.875 --> 00:03:18.750
I'll look after Croccy here.

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:22.083
Go find Cooper.

